{"5049480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Magic Kitchen", "steam_appid": 5049480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5141660], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic Kitchen is a casual restaurant game build for people focusing more on perfection than on pressure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Orders</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every customer has their own demands. Each meal is built from a mix of magical mushrooms and other ingredients that change how a dish looks, tastes, and scores. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two orders play out quite the same way. Have a customer with a different demand and you're making a completely different meal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049480/extras/a92319ef2d174334dcc73928a6d4d12d.poster.avif?t=1787346289\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049480/extras/a92319ef2d174334dcc73928a6d4d12d.webm?t=1787346289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049480/extras/a92319ef2d174334dcc73928a6d4d12d.mp4?t=1787346289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get new tools</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're starting with a very simple restaurant, just making potions with mushrooms. But this will soon change to be a kitchen that's way more alive and has way more options. Get new utilities and buy new ingredients to keep improving your kitchen. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049480/extras/8d0bba3656b87f7dbfdcd8db671fb2e2.poster.avif?t=1787346289\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049480/extras/8d0bba3656b87f7dbfdcd8db671fb2e2.webm?t=1787346289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049480/extras/8d0bba3656b87f7dbfdcd8db671fb2e2.mp4?t=1787346289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make your kitchen reach 5/5 stars!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success means taking care of your customers. Listening to their demands, timing your cooking right and finding the perfect combinations of ingredients. All these efforts will lead you to make your restaurant a 5 star restaurant, which is the ultimate goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049480/extras/b72184848fa4f232b5f876aad70a4fcd.avif?t=1787346289\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049480/extras_big/b72184848fa4f232b5f876aad70a4fcd.avif?t=1787346289 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Couch co-op mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Team up with a friend in local co-op to make your kitchen even better! The easiest way to get many perfect meals is with two players! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049480/extras/05160a57c4868c3eaa525724ad0a1e4b.poster.avif?t=1787346289\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049480/extras/05160a57c4868c3eaa525724ad0a1e4b.webm?t=1787346289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049480/extras/05160a57c4868c3eaa525724ad0a1e4b.mp4?t=1787346289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic Kitchen is a casual restaurant game build for people focusing more on perfection than on pressure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Orders</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every customer has their own demands. Each meal is built from a mix of magical mushrooms and other ingredients that change how a dish looks, tastes, and scores. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two orders play out quite the same way. Have a customer with a different demand and you're making a completely different meal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049480/extras/a92319ef2d174334dcc73928a6d4d12d.poster.avif?t=1787346289\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049480/extras/a92319ef2d174334dcc73928a6d4d12d.webm?t=1787346289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049480/extras/a92319ef2d174334dcc73928a6d4d12d.mp4?t=1787346289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get new tools</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're starting with a very simple restaurant, just making potions with mushrooms. But this will soon change to be a kitchen that's way more alive and has way more options. Get new utilities and buy new ingredients to keep improving your kitchen. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049480/extras/8d0bba3656b87f7dbfdcd8db671fb2e2.poster.avif?t=1787346289\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049480/extras/8d0bba3656b87f7d